            "source": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/66/r2/final",
            "description": "HIPAA Security Rule safeguards implemented by the governed intake API. NIST SP 800-66 Rev. 2 is cited as the catalog because no official HIPAA OSCAL catalog exists; each control-id is a token for a 164.x section, and the exact section is in the hipaa-section prop.",
